== Overview ==
The Toilet is a unit that can be summoned in the [[Noob Toilet Crate]], it is a [[basic]] unit to be summoned, and one of the [[basic]] units in the game. It is inspired by the default [[Toilet]] in the game, or preferably in the original series.

