== Trivia ==

* This is most unskibidi skibidi toilet.
* As of now, around '''30 million''' copies of this specific toilet exist.
* This could be the best bait for toilets that stun, (a decent alternative to [[Camerawoman]] in terms of stunbait) if you have none.
* This is the cheapest unit but many people sell it for ten gems in the marketplace.
* This is based off The [https://skibidi-toilet.fandom.com/wiki/Normal_Skibidi_Toilet Normal Skibidi Toilet] and similar toilets.
* This is cheapest unit to place, even cheaper than [[Camerawoman]].
* This is the only toilet-related unit that is a [[Basic]].
